# Build context for the web Dockerfile — skip workspace noise
# (other modules' go.mod/go.sum drift from `go work sync`),
# demo logs, build outputs, .git, .superpowers scratch.
.git/
.superpowers/
bin/
docs/demo/logs/
nul
*.log

# Skip unrelated workspace modules' go.mod/go.sum drift (not used by web build but irrelevant to COPY . . target).
# Actually we DON'T skip them: COPY . . needs everything for go.work resolution.
# We only skip .git and demo scratch.
